║  IF QUESTION CONTAINS:              → USE:                                  ║
║  ═════════════════════════════        ═══════════════════════════════════   ║
║                                                                             ║
║  "with their X", "matching"         → INNER JOIN                            ║
║  "all employees even if..."         → LEFT JOIN                             ║
║  "all departments even if..."       → LEFT JOIN (departments first)         ║
║  "find missing", "no match"         → LEFT JOIN + WHERE IS NULL             ║
║  "compared to same table"           → SELF JOIN                             ║
║  "together with X and Y"            → MULTIPLE JOINS                        ║
